  "details": "- Personally, It feels crammed.\n\n- Keyboard UI having alignment issues (sometimes snapping to the ui and other times dont, positioning around can feel pretty uncomfortable).\n\n- the new chat ui cannot be moved around (old UI can be draggable, This also contributes to the alignment issues for the new keyboard UI).\n\nWould be nice if the old keyboard layout would revitalized as an option in-case if people still struggling to quickly type on it.",
